# L §5.18 check e == f: "ok, or differs: e = …, f = … and the difference e − f; a hole or refused side prints in its
# place (? with its questions, or refused: …), with the other side's value beside it (e = 120.00 PLN, f = ?)".
# 120.00 − 100.00 = 20.00 PLN.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input a: money PLN
input b: money PLN
input c: money PLN
input h: money PLN

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  a = 120.00 PLN
  b = 100.00 PLN
  c = 120.00 PLN
  h = ?"what was recorded?"

ask c1: check a == c
ask c2: check a == b
ask c3: check a == h
=== expect
c1: ok
  cut 2026-12-31
c2: differs: a = 120.00 PLN, b = 100.00 PLN, difference 20.00 PLN
  cut 2026-12-31
c3: a = 120.00 PLN, h = ?"what was recorded?" (h)
  cut 2026-12-31
